          {
            "id": "L-S2E03-C01-T01",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Hope",
              "version": "Hope"
            },
            "text": "They say that it's better to have loved and lost than never to have loved at all."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E03-C01-T02",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Hope",
              "version": "Hope"
            },
            "text": "Whoever wrote that clearly never experienced the love of their life forgetting their whole existence."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E03-C01-T03",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Hope",
              "version": "Hope"
            },
            "text": "It makes you want to be alone, because you can't lose what you never had."
          }
        ]
      },
