      ],
      "importance": 3,
      "verified": true,
      "full": {
        "turns": [
          {
            "id": "L-S2E03-C07-T01",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Hope",
              "version": "Hope"
            },
            "action": "holds Landon's hoodie"
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E03-C07-T02",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Hope",
              "version": "Hope"
            },
            "action": "touches Landon's guitar"
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E03-C07-T03",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Hope",
              "version": "Hope"
            },
            "text": "Stop, stop, stop. You're here for a reason."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E03-C07-T04",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Landon",
              "version": "Hopeless Landon"
            },
            "text": "What are you doing in my room?"
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E03-C07-T05",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Hope",
              "version": "Hope"
            },
            "text": "Uh... look, I know that this looks bad..."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E03-C07-T06",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Landon",
              "version": "Hopeless Landon"
            },
            "text": "No. It looks like magic."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E03-C07-T07",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Hope",
              "version": "Hope"
            },
            "text": "Corporis impetus!"
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E03-C07-T08",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Landon",
              "version": "Hopeless Landon"
            },
            "text": "I'm starting to think you're not some ordinary girl."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E03-C07-T09",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Hope",
              "version": "Hope"
            },
            "text": "Look, my name is Hope, okay? I-I'm a witch. I'm working with Dr. Saltzman. He asked me to do a locater spell to find Rafael."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E03-C07-T10",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Landon",
              "version": "Hopeless Landon"
            },
            "text": "Why wouldn't he ask one of his own daughters?"
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E03-C07-T11",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Hope",
              "version": "Hope"
            },
            "text": "Because they don't know about the Crescent Wolf Clan. Not like I do."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E03-C07-T12",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Landon",
              "version": "Hopeless Landon"
            },
            "text": "Wol... I-I've read about that. Does that mean you can turn Raf back?"
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E03-C07-T13",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Hope",
              "version": "Hope"
            },
            "text": "There is a monster in the woods, and it feeds on werewolves."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E03-C07-T14",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Landon",
              "version": "Hopeless Landon"
            },
            "text": "Ooh. Then I'm coming with you."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E03-C07-T15",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Hope",
              "version": "Hope"
            },
            "text": "Sorry, but I fly solo."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E03-C07-T16",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Landon",
              "version": "Hopeless Landon"
            },
            "text": "Uh... He's my best friend."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E03-C07-T17",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Hope",
              "version": "Hope"
            },
            "text": "You do realize I could freeze you again, right?"
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E03-C07-T18",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Landon",
              "version": "Hopeless Landon"
            },
            "text": "Would that spell last forever?"
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E03-C07-T19",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Hope",
              "version": "Hope"
            },
            "text": "Just try to keep up."
          }
        ]
      },
