    {
      "id": "L-S2E03-C08",
      "title": "Hope tells Landon he doesn't have to worry about anyone forgetting him.",
      "description": "Walking through the woods to find Rafael, Landon admits he is afraid Raf has moved on. Hope, who knows exactly how it feels, tells him it is painful to lose someone you love.",
      "participants": [
        {
          "character": "Hope",
          "version": "Hope"
        },
        {
          "character": "Landon",
          "version": "Hopeless Landon"
        }
      ],
      "subjects": [],
      "scene_type": "conversation",
      "tags": [
        "forgotten",
        "comfort",
        "love",
        "angst",
        "trust"
      ],
      "importance": 4,
      "verified": true,
      "full": {
        "turns": [
          {
            "id": "L-S2E03-C08-T01",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Hope",
              "version": "Hope"
            },
            "text": "Yeah, Raf should be up ahead."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E03-C08-T02",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Landon",
              "version": "Hopeless Landon"
            },
            "text": "Cool."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E03-C08-T03",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Hope",
              "version": "Hope"
            },
            "text": "Meaning not cool?"
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E03-C08-T04",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Landon",
              "version": "Hopeless Landon"
            },
            "text": "Sorry. It's just... nothing."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E03-C08-T05",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Hope",
              "version": "Hope"
            },
            "text": "Meaning something."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E03-C08-T06",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Landon",
              "version": "Hopeless Landon"
            },
            "text": "It's stupid, but when Raf was first stuck as a wolf, he used to always hang out with me, but then he, like, he stopped. Like, he forgot or he moved on."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E03-C08-T07",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Hope",
              "version": "Hope"
            },
            "text": "And you're worried that it's gonna be the same when he's human again?"
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E03-C08-T08",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Landon",
              "version": "Hopeless Landon"
            },
            "text": "Told you it was stupid."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E03-C08-T09",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Hope",
              "version": "Hope"
            },
            "text": "I don't think it's stupid. It's painful to lose someone that you love."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E03-C08-T10",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Landon",
              "version": "Hopeless Landon"
            },
            "text": "Yeah. Oh, I know all about that. I grew up in the foster system. Getting bounced around from family to family made me want to shut everybody out until I realized life's a lot harder without someone watching your back."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E03-C08-T11",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Hope",
              "version": "Hope"
            },
            "text": "Trust me, Landon, you don't have to worry about anyone forgetting you."
          }
        ]
      },
      "short": {
        "turns": [
          {
            "id": "L-S2E03-C08-T09",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Hope",
              "version": "Hope"
            },
            "text": "I don't think it's stupid. It's painful to lose someone that you love."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E03-C08-T10",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Landon",
              "version": "Hopeless Landon"
            },
            "text": "Yeah. Oh, I know all about that. I grew up in the foster system. Getting bounced around from family to family made me want to shut everybody out until I realized life's a lot harder without someone watching your back."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E03-C08-T11",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Hope",
              "version": "Hope"
            },
            "text": "Trust me, Landon, you don't have to worry about anyone forgetting you."
          }
        ]
